     "href": "/cn/zh/rooms/childrens-room/gallery/ertongfang-puba8409680",
     "backgroundColor": null
    },
    {
     "title": "专为阳光活泼的儿童打造",
     "text": "创建一个共享的卧室，让你的孩子们可以在里面玩耍休息",
     "image": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/b4/df/b4df5b4943e52f817440dd75da73db43.jpg",
